## The project

We created the UI kits for CONTPAQi's convention apps (Algarabía 2022 and Sincronía 2023) with the events company EvenTwo, which provided the CRM that powered the app. It was a web app that could be updated on the fly as the event required.

The app included the agenda, speakers, sponsors, program, hotel map, photos and extra information. Its notifications kept attendees on schedule during the event and after it, with flights and hotel pickup times.

{% figure src="/images/projects/convencion/ui-kit.png" alt="Event app UI kit" wide=true /%}

## Main challenges

- Building the UI kits.
- Creating assets within the vendor's constraints.
- UX writing and information synthesis.
- Turning around push notifications quickly as the company needed.
